RT @Ldnbox: 10 Best SEO MCP Servers 

1. mcp-gsc by AminForou (open-source) - connect Claude to Google Search Console

2. Ahrefs MCP - Ahrefs API access and real Ahrefs data

3. DataForSEO MCP - gives you keyword volumes, live SERPs, backlinks, and on-page audits. 

4. Apify MCP - thousands of ready-made scrapers, including Reddit, Google Maps and Amazon, etc. 

5. Playwright MCP - controls a real browser, for pages that need clicking or logging in; 

6. WordPress MCP - lets Claude create drafts, edit posts, and manage website content directly

7. Brave Search MCP - access to AI web search through Brave's own index; 

8. ElevenLabs MCP - text-to-speech from Claude; 

9. Stripe MCP - look up payments, subscriptions and invoices; 

10. YouTube transcript MCP - pulls transcripts from any video. Useful for content research, for repurposing videos into articles; 

What's missing here?
